# Powder or lump: surface area is computed before rate is
# Grinding computes exposed area. This carbonate route has no area-dependent
# rate, so equal one-step outcomes are a model boundary, not a real prediction.
register lv2
add v1 chalk_stick 2g
grind v1 CaCO3 50um
add v1 white_vinegar_5_percent 50mL
look v1
new beaker
add v2 chalk_stick 2g
add v2 white_vinegar_5_percent 50mL
look v2
